    "type_designations": ["D-Legal"],
    "module_designation": "Non-automatic digital weighing indicator",
    "description": "The D-Legal digital indicator consists of a D-Legal program running on a Windows PC. When the D-Legal program is started a window appears in the most upper part of the screen showing the weight; this window cannot be closed and a double click starts the standard digital indicator window. D-Legal is intended for use with a Dini Argeo weight transmitter, connected to the PC via USB, ethernet, serial port or wireless; the connecting cable or wireless connection is with an electronic board that secures the pairing of the weight transmitter and the D-Legal software via a special Dini Argeo protocol. The D-Legal software can only be activated on a PC by the manufacturer using a special software key that pairs the weight transmitter and the D-Legal software permanently and uniquely. D-Legal can alternatively be configured as a secondary display for a Dini Argeo indicator, in which configuration the zero and tare keys are disabled."
